BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 580.0 Tm (FAT32 format details are extremely sensitive to boundary arithmetic. Reader and writer must) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 51 563.0 Tm (check BPB sector geometry, FAT bounds, root-cluster validity and all cluster-chain links.) Tj ET
